  '58-0': ['overalls|boxy', "side view of the whole big blue van parked by the gray sidewalk with its front facing right. Dan stands on the sidewalk in front of the middle of the van, smiling proudly, one hand resting flat on the closed sliding side door and his other hand giving a thumbs-up. Every door of the van is closed: the front driver door, the sliding side door and the back door. The sliding side door is the same bright blue as the van. Only one person, no animals"], '58-1': ['boxy', "side view of the whole big blue van parked alone on the quiet street with its front facing right, the whole van is visible from bumper to bumper. It is big and tall, much taller than the small red mailbox and the low hedge next to it. Every door is closed. No people, no animals, no bicycles"], '58-2': ["overalls|inside back|cooking pot", "seen from behind the big blue van parked on the street: the big back door at the rear is wide open, showing the empty inside of the van with a flat light wooden floor and the gray front seats far inside; the front doors are closed. Dan stands on the street at the open back of the van and holds the big silver cooking pot with its lid on in front of him, his left hand gripping the pot's left black handle and his right hand gripping the pot's right black handle, setting it down on the wooden floor inside. Only one person, only one pot, no cat"], '58-3': ["overalls|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat", "seen from the open back of the van looking in toward the gray front seats: a flat light wooden floor and light blue walls. Dan kneels on the wooden floor inside the van and spreads the flat green mat out on the floor with both hands, the big silver pot with its lid on already stands on the floor beside the mat. The mat is inside the van. Only one person, only one pot, only one mat, no cat"], '58-4': ["tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat", "seen from behind the big blue van parked on the street: the big back door at the rear is wide open, and the orange cat leaps from the street up into the back of the van, in mid-air with its front paws stretched toward the green mat lying flat on the light wooden floor inside, its tail up. The big silver pot with its lid on stands on the floor next to the mat. Through the van we see the gray front seats; the front doors of the van are closed. No people, only one cat, only one pot"], '58-5': ['tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat', "seen from the open back of the van looking in toward the gray front seats: a flat light wooden floor, light blue walls and a small square window. The orange cat sits happily on the flat green mat on the floor, its tail curled around its white paws. The big silver pot with its lid on stands on the wooden floor inside the van right next to the mat. Everything is inside the van, nothing outside. No people, only one cat, only one pot"], '58-6': ["overalls|tabby|boxy", "side view of the big blue van parked by the sidewalk with its front facing right. Every door of the van is closed: the front driver door is closed, the sliding side door is closed and the back door is closed. Dan already sits inside in the driver seat, seen through the front side window, smiling with his hands on the steering wheel. The orange cat's face peeks out of the window of the closed sliding side door. Nobody outside on the sidewalk. Only one person, only one cat"], '58-7': ['overalls|tabby|boxy', "seen from a little far away, the big blue van drives fast to the right along the country road between green hills, with speed lines and a little dust behind it. Every door is closed. Dan sits at the steering wheel behind the front window, smiling, and the orange cat's face looks out of the window of the closed sliding side door. Only one person, only one cat. The cat is inside the van, only its face shows in the side window, no cat outside on the road"], '58-8': ['overalls|boxy', "side view of the big blue van on the country road with its front facing right: its front wheels bounce up over a small round bump in the road, the van tilts back a little, short bounce lines and a puff of dust. Every door is closed and the sliding side door is the same bright blue as the van. Dan at the steering wheel behind the front window looks surprised. Only one person"], '58-9': ['tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat', "seen from the open back of the van looking in toward the gray front seats: a flat light wooden floor, light blue walls and a small window with green hills outside. The van just hit a bump: the big silver pot has slid onto the edge of the green mat and is tipping over sideways, its lid still on, about to fall. The orange cat sitting on the mat jumps up in surprise with puffed fur and wide eyes. Bounce lines. Only one cat, only one pot, only one lid"], '58-10': ['tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat', "seen from the open back of the van looking in toward the gray front seats: a flat light wooden floor and light blue walls. The big silver pot is lying on its side on the green mat, not standing upright, its open top turned toward the cat. Its round silver lid has fallen off and lies on the wooden floor beside the mat, still wobbling, with little motion lines. Round golden-brown bread buns are just visible inside the pot opening, all still inside. The orange cat stands on the mat and stares at the pot. Only one cat, only one pot, only one lid"], '58-11': ["tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat", "a close look inside the back of the blue van: the big silver pot lies on its side on the green mat with its round open mouth facing straight toward us like a big silver circle, and the circle is filled with exactly six round golden-brown bread buns, warm steam curling up from them. The pot's two small black handles stick out on the left and right of its round rim. Nothing sits on top of the pot. The orange cat stands beside the pot looking at the buns in surprise. One round silver lid lies flat on the wooden floor. Only one cat, only one pot, only one lid"], '58-12': ["tabby|inside back|cooking pot|floor mat", "seen from the open back of the van looking in toward the gray front seats: the big silver pot is lying on its side on the green mat, not standing upright, with no lid on it, and two round golden-brown bread buns have rolled out of its opening onto the mat, warm steam. The orange cat crouches low and sniffs one of the rolled-out buns with its pink nose almost touching it. Exactly one round silver lid lies flat on the wooden floor, only one lid in the whole picture. Only one cat, only one pot"], '58-13': ['overalls|boxy', "side view of the big blue van parked on the grassy roadside with its front facing right, green hills behind. The sliding side door and the back door are closed. Only the front driver door is open, and Dan steps down out of it, one boot already on the grass, one hand holding the open door. Only one person"], '58-14': ['overalls|tabby|boxy|cooking pot', "Dan and the orange cat sit side by side on the green grass in bright warm sunshine next to the big blue van parked by the road, a big bright sun in the blue sky. All the van doors are closed. Dan sits cross-legged with a happy relaxed face, the cat sits by his knee with its eyes half closed in the warm sun. The big silver pot with its lid on stands on the grass in front of them. Only one person, only one cat, only one pot"], '58-15': ["overalls|tabby|cooking pot", "a closer look at Dan and the orange cat sitting on the sunny green grass eating bread buns. Dan holds one round golden-brown bun as big as his palm and takes a bite, smiling. The cat sits on the grass to the right of Dan and nibbles a small round bun in front of it, happy. Beside them the big silver pot stands upright with its lid off, more buns inside. Yum. Exactly one cat with exactly one striped tail, nothing behind Dan. Only one person, only one cat, only one pot"],
